From: Johannes Pletzer <johannes.pletzer@posteo.de>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:28:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Render write_tag_closure! and energy_source_audit in the
 docs

The docs build failed: the docstrings of write_tag_audit! and
tag_closure_callback! link to energy_source_audit and to
write_tag_closure!, and no page rendered either. The check in
docs/check_docstring_refs.jl refuses a link to a symbol no page renders.
Both are now in the API blocks of the pages that describe them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LA3FukgbRCMkra999BhdDw
---
 docs/src/energy_source_tags.md   | 1 +
 docs/src/tracer_configuration.md | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/docs/src/energy_source_tags.md b/docs/src/energy_source_tags.md
index 0066940..214b382 100644
--- a/docs/src/energy_source_tags.md
+++ b/docs/src/energy_source_tags.md
@@ -348,4 +348,5 @@ ClimaAtmos.warn_inactive_energy_source_labels
 ClimaAtmos.energy_source_fraction
 ClimaAtmos.snapshot_energy_source_tags!
 ClimaAtmos.attribute_energy_source_tags!
+ClimaAtmos.energy_source_audit
 ```
diff --git a/docs/src/tracer_configuration.md b/docs/src/tracer_configuration.md
index 1dbda9b..30ee5a4 100644
--- a/docs/src/tracer_configuration.md
+++ b/docs/src/tracer_configuration.md
@@ -564,4 +564,5 @@ ClimaAtmos.tag_closure
 ClimaAtmos.tag_audit
 ClimaAtmos.tag_closure_callback
 ClimaAtmos.tag_closure_callback!
+ClimaAtmos.write_tag_closure!
 ```
